  "A minimum grade point average of 2.0 is required in the major.",
  "Students must receive a grade of C– or better in any course counted toward fulfillment of the major requirements.",
  "All courses taken to satisfy the program’s lower and upper-division requirements must be taken for a letter grade.",
  "HDS 1, HDS 150, HDS 181, and HDS 191 must be taken in residence. No substitutions will be approved.",
  "The BS specialization in equity and diversity includes the same thirteen course requirements as the traditional BS. However, elective course work has been substituted with the following three concentration courses."
 ]
